# Evidence captures are live output from the running app — real card text, real
# mail subjects, real session prompts, real PR titles. The QA_EVIDENCE set
# already committed is deliberate; new ones are not, and a `git add -A` swept a
# whole run in once without anyone looking at it.
#
# Matched as a family rather than by name because the second one to appear was
# called IA_EVIDENCE, an hour later, mid-capture. `git add -f` to include one on
# purpose.
*_EVIDENCE/

# The revamp brief. Same reason as the evidence directories above: it quotes
# real card titles, real session prompts and real mail subjects verbatim, and it
# names the operator's live Truto profiles by count. It is a working document,
# not a shipped one.
detailed.md
